title=7+Lost+Expeditions+Into+the+Warpstorm&slug=lost-expedition-stories&content=%3Ch1%3E7+Lost+Expeditions+Into+the+Warpstorm%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Seven+fleets+entered+the+Warpstorm+and+never+returned+as+themselves%3A+a+colonisation+convoy+that+aged+backwards%2C+a+salvage+armada+found+rusted+shut%2C+a+pilgrim+fleet+whose+only+transmission+now+loops+forever+at+the+storm%27s+edge.+These+are+short%2C+atmospheric+stories+from+the+dark+side+of+our+original+sci-fi+universe.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EWarpstorm+is+an+original+fictional+universe.+All+expeditions+below+are+fiction.+Not+affiliated+with+any+other+sci-fi+franchise.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E1.+The+Provision+Convoy+%3Cem%3EHalcyon+Grace%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EEleven+colony+ships%2C+escorted%2C+fully+provisioned%2C+left+the+Meridian+Yards+for+the+outer+rim.+They+entered+the+storm+corridor+on+schedule.+Nineteen+hours+later%2C+the+%3Cem%3EHalcyon+Grace%3C%2Fem%3E+emerged+%E2%80%94+alone%2C+intact%2C+and+eleven+years+older+than+its+departure+date.+Its+crew+of+4%2C000+had+become+612.+The+survivors+remembered+a+crossing+that+%22took+a+while.%22+The+colony+fleet+behind+them+was+never+found.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E2.+The+Salvage+Armada+%3Cem%3EIron+Tithe%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EEight+salvage+vessels+answered+a+ghost-ship+distress+call+inside+the+storm.+A+patrol+found+the+armada+four+months+later%2C+all+eight+hulls+fused+nose-to-stern+in+a+single+chain%2C+every+airlock+welded+from+the+%3Cem%3Einside%3C%2Fem%3E.+No+bodies.+The+salvage+in+their+holds+was+logged+as+complete+%E2%80%94+cargo+that+no+registry+has+ever+matched.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E3.+The+Pilgrim+Fleet+%3Cem%3EVoice+of+the+Deep%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThree+thousand+faithful+follow+a+signal+they+believe+comes+from+beyond+the+storm%27s+heart.+Every+year+they+sail+one+wave+closer.+Every+year+their+transmission+repeats%2C+unchanged%2C+on+the+same+frequency%3A+%3Cem%3E%22We+are+almost+there.+We+are+almost+there.+We+are+almost+there.%22%3C%2Fem%3E+The+signal+predates+the+fleet+by+two+centuries.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E4.+The+Charting+Mission+%3Cem%3ECartographer%27s+Oath%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+Oath%27s+mission+was+to+map+the+storm%27s+interior+for+the+first+time+in+a+generation.+Its+final+log+entry+%E2%80%94+verified+authentic+%E2%80%94+reads%3A+%3Cem%3E%22Chart+complete.+Do+not+use.+Do+not+use.+The+routes+are+alive.+Do+not%E2%80%94%22%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+chart+was+transmitted%2C+in+full%2C+to+fleet+command.+It+is+accurate.+It+is+complete.+Every+navigator+who+has+followed+it+has+been+lost.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E5.+The+Dredger+%3Cem%3EMarrow+Sun%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+mining+dredger+harvesting+storm-metal+from+a+wreck+field+reported+impossible+yields+%E2%80%94+ore+that+continued+humming+after+extraction.+On+the+final+day+of+contact%2C+its+captain+transmitted+a+single+image%3A+the+dredger%27s+own+hull%2C+photographed+from+the+outside%2C+rusted+beyond+recognition%2C+%3Cem%3Ewhile+the+crew+was+still+alive+inside+it%3C%2Fem%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E6.+The+Escort+Squadron+%3Cem%3ENine+Lanterns%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3ENine+warships+escorted+a+courier+through+a+surge.+Eight+emerged.+The+ninth+%E2%80%94+the+%3Cem%3ELantern+Vigil%3C%2Fem%3E+%E2%80%94+continues+to+appear+on+every+subsequent+expedition%27s+sensors%2C+always+ahead+of+the+fleet%2C+always+escorting%2C+never+answering+hails.+Veterans+refuse+to+acknowledge+it.+It+has+been+seen+for+forty+years.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3E7.+The+Returned+%3Cem%3ESecond+Dawn%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+only+expedition+to+return+%3Cem%3Echanged+but+alive%3C%2Fem%3E.+The+crew+stepped+out+of+the+airlock%2C+reported+an+uneventful+crossing%2C+and+requested+their+pay.+They+had+been+gone+eighty+years.+They+had+not+aged.+They+all+%E2%80%94+every+member%2C+independently+%E2%80%94+request+the+same+posting%3A+back+into+the+storm.+Fleet+command+has+denied+all+of+them.+Twice.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhere+the+Storm+Keeps+Its+Dead%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EExpedition%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhat+entered%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhat+came+back%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EHalcyon+Grace%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EColony+convoy%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ETime-skewed+survivors%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EIron+Tithe%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESalvage+armada%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EWelded%2C+empty+hulks%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EVoice+of+the+Deep%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EPilgrim+fleet%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAn+eternal+loop%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECartographer%27s+Oath%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECharting+mission%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EA+map+that+kills%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EMarrow+Sun%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMining+dredger%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ERust+with+a+heartbeat%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ENine+Lanterns%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EEscort+squadron%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EA+ghost+that+guards%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ESecond+Dawn%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECourier+run%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EA+crew+that+won%27t+stay+out%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+Into+the+Storm%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fwhat-is-the-warpstorm%2F%22%3EWhat+Is+the+Warpstorm%3F%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+begin+the+universe+here%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fchaotic-factions%2F%22%3EThe+Fractured+Factions%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+who+rides+the+storm%27s+edge%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fwarp-travel-explained%2F%22%3EWarp+Travel+Explained%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+routes+that+failed+them%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Frust-and-battle-damage%2F%22%3EHow+to+Paint+Rust%2C+Chipping+and+Battle+Damage%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+build+the+%3Cem%3EIron+Tithe%3C%2Fem%3E+look+yourself%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESeven+expeditions.+Seven+lessons.+The+storm+counts+everything.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Explore+the+factions+next.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish